==Trivia==
*The name of this weapon refers to the [[vampyre|vampyric]] [[Vampyre Houses#House Vitur|House Vitur]], whose [[Gods#Founder of House Vitur|founder]] was worshipped as a god and wielded this scythe.
*An uncharged Scythe of Vitur, along with three [[Ghrazi rapier]]s, can be [[Weapons (Death's Office)|seen]] leaning against a wall in [[Death's Office]].
*A [[Jagex Moderator]]-[[Scythe of vitur (rotten)|exclusive ''rotten'' variant]] of this item exists which allows the user to kill any player instantly.

